{# #### `project_business_name` #}

{{SetCustomerMetadataAttribute(
    idn="project_business_name",
    field="multiple_fields",
    value={ "description": """The short, customer-recognized business name the Agent uses in greetings, SMS/email headers, and
signatures.

**Pro-Tip:** Keep this name customer-recognized and easy to say. For day-to-day conversation
quality, a concise name is usually best. For hospitality availability checks that use the default
method, prioritize the exact hotel name as it appears on Google Maps (even if it is longer). For
multi-location brands, include the specific location. If voice calls need better pronunciation, also
fill in the Business Phonetic Name.

For hospitality availability checks that use the default method, enter the exact hotel name as it
appears on Google Maps (same spelling). The name should be unique enough to identify the correct
property. If it is not unique, also provide your Google Maps business link in the \"Booking - Check
Availability - Link (URL)\" setting to improve identification accuracy.

**Examples:**

```txt
Menlo Tavern
```

```txt
Example Hotel - Downtown
```

---

**⚙️ Technical & System Details (Advanced)**

**System Usage:** Injected into Agent persona, VibeAgent configuration/coaching replies, voice
greetings, SMS/email templates, and calendar/meeting titles as the primary business label. When a
phonetic business name is provided, the system replaces this name inside voice greeting phrases to
improve pronunciation. If returning greeting phrases are not set, default voice greetings may be
generated using this name. For hospitality availability checks, this value is passed as the
`hotelName` in the availability payload, and a provided business URL is passed as `businessUrl` to
help the external availability provider identify the intended listing.

**Fallbacks:** On first initialization, the system attempts to populate this from Agent Creator
business info. If it remains empty, downstream templates may use a generic placeholder or omit the
name. When the default hospitality availability check is enabled and this field is empty, the
availability check is blocked and a system warning is logged.

**Dependencies:**

- **Primary Settings:**
  - `project_business_name_phonetic`: Used to replace this name in voice greetings for accurate
    pronunciation.
- **Logic Interactions:**
  - `project_representative_agent_voice_greeting_phrase`: Phonetic replacement only works when this
    phrase includes the business name.
  - `project_representative_agent_voice_greeting_phrase_recent_returning`: If empty, default
    returning greetings may be generated using this name.
  - `project_representative_agent_voice_greeting_phrase_later_returning`: If empty, default
    returning greetings may be generated using this name.
  - `project_representative_agent_voice_disclaimer_phrase`: Prepended to the voice greeting phrase
    before delivery.
  - `project_representative_agent_chat_greeting_phrase`: Chat greeting content is separate; include
    the business name there if you want it spoken in chat.
  - `project_attributes_setting_email_sender_name`: If empty, it is auto-derived using the business
    name.
  - `project_attributes_setting_booking_check_availability_type`: When this advanced system
    configuration is set to `default`, this name is required and sent as `hotelName` for the
    hospitality availability request.
  - `project_attributes_setting_booking_check_availability_url`: If provided, it is used as the
    `businessUrl` hint in the hospitality availability request.""", "is_hidden": False }
)}}

